# v4.1 unified-sidecar §2.5 — agent INGRESS front for system: langflow (tenant: default)
# Restores gateway/backoffice dispatch severed by the §2.6 split-ringfence
# migration (I1-02): dispatchers dial THIS mesh listener; Caddy — the sole
# legitimate co-member of ringfence_langflow_in — proxies to the agent.
